name 'designing-reliable-apps-postassessment-q2_2025'

question 'A developer receives this API response: {"user": {"name": "Priya", "favorites": ["jazz", "afrobeats", "cumbia"]}}. Which statement about this data structure is accurate?'

right '"favorites" is an array nested inside an object, which is itself nested inside another object'
wrong '"favorites" is an object with three key-value pairs'
wrong 'The entire response is an array of user objects'
wrong '"user" is a value that belongs to the "name" key'

allow_multiple_attempts true

